          "id": "ml-trees-ensembles-block-3",
          "html": "<marimo-island\n    data-app-id=\"mlphd\"\n    data-cell-id=\"elJp\"\n    data-reactive=\"true\"\n>\n    <marimo-cell-output>\n    <span></span>\n    </marimo-cell-output>\n    <marimo-cell-code hidden>ml_exercise_03_description%20%3D%20mo.md(%22%22%22%0A%23%23%23%20Exercise%0A%0ADefine%20%60choose_ensemble(priority)%60%20returning%20%60%22random_forest%22%60%20for%0A%60%22robust_default%22%60%20and%20%60%22gradient_boosting%22%60%20for%20%60%22maximum_accuracy%22%60.%0A%22%22%22)%0Aml_exercise_03_starter%20%3D%20mo.ui.code_editor(%0A%20%20%20%20value%3D'def%20choose_ensemble(priority)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20priority%20%3D%3D%20%22robust_default%22%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20%22random_forest%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20priority%20%3D%3D%20%22maximum_accuracy%22%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20%22gradient_boosting%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20%22decision_tree%22'%2C%0A%20%20%20%20language%3D%22python%22%2C%20label%3D%22Your%20Python%20answer%22%2C%20min_height%3D170%2C%0A)%0Aml_exercise_03_submit%20%3D%20mo.ui.run_button(label%3D%22Submit%20answer%22)</marimo-cell-code>\n</marimo-island>",
          "visible": false
        },
        {
          "id": "ml-trees-ensembles-block-4",
          "html": "<marimo-island\n            data-app-id=\"mlphd\"\n            data-cell-id=\"EyBw\"\n            data-reactive=\"true\"\n        >\n            <marimo-cell-output><marimo-ui-element data-mlphd-island-source-guard hidden object-id='1fdb5ecf-5cc9-c885-e04a-e1680c9f4aa8' random-id='1fdb5ecf-5cc9-c885-e04a-e1680c9f4aa8'><marimo-code-editor data-initial-value='&quot;@assertion(lambda _ns: None)&#92;ndef _submission(source):&#92;n    _ns = execute_submission(source)&#92;n    _fn = _ns[&#92;&quot;choose_ensemble&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    assert _fn(&#92;&quot;robust_default&#92;&quot;) == &#92;&quot;random_forest&#92;&quot;, &#92;&quot;use bagging for the robust default&#92;&quot;&#92;n    assert _fn(&#92;&quot;maximum_accuracy&#92;&quot;) == &#92;&quot;gradient_boosting&#92;&quot;, &#92;&quot;use boosting for tuned predictive power&#92;&quot;&#92;n    return _ns&#92;n&#92;nproblem(mo, ml_exercise_03_description, ml_exercise_03_starter, _submission, ml_exercise_03_submit)&quot;' data-label='null' data-language='&quot;python&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-show-copy-button='true' data-debounce='false'></marimo-code-editor></marimo-ui-element>\n            <div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 1rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"exercise\">Exercise</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Define <code>choose_ensemble(priority)</code> returning <code>\"random_forest\"</code> for\n<code>\"robust_default\"</code> and <code>\"gradient_boosting\"</code> for <code>\"maximum_accuracy\"</code>.</span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='elJp-0' random-id='e9a027dc-0b28-9f86-ab8a-712bda4fa757'><marimo-code-editor data-initial-value='&quot;def choose_ensemble(priority):&#92;n    if priority == &#92;&quot;robust_default&#92;&quot;:&#92;n        return &#92;&quot;random_forest&#92;&quot;&#92;n    if priority == &#92;&quot;maximum_accuracy&#92;&quot;:&#92;n        return &#92;&quot;gradient_boosting&#92;&quot;&#92;n    return &#92;&quot;decision_tree&#92;&quot;&quot;' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eYour Python answer&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-language='&quot;python&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-min-height='170' data-show-copy-button='true' data-debounce='false'></marimo-code-editor></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='elJp-1' random-id='61afbfc7-362f-e63f-e625-543f18ecefdc'><marimo-button data-initial-value='0' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eSubmit answer&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-button></marimo-ui-element><marimo-callout-output data-html='&quot;&#92;u003cspan&#92;u003eEdit the answer, then click Submit answer.&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;'></marimo-callout-output></div>\n            </marimo-cell-output>\n            <marimo-cell-code hidden>%40assertion(lambda%20_ns%3A%20None)%0Adef%20_submission(source)%3A%0A%20%20%20%20_ns%20%3D%20execute_submission(source)%0A%20%20%20%20_fn%20%3D%20_ns%5B%22choose_ensemble%22%5D%0A%20%20%20%20assert%20_fn(%22robust_default%22)%20%3D%3D%20%22random_forest%22%2C%20%22use%20bagging%20for%20the%20robust%20default%22%0A%20%20%20%20assert%20_fn(%22maximum_accuracy%22)%20%3D%3D%20%22gradient_boosting%22%2C%20%22use%20boosting%20for%20tuned%20predictive%20power%22%0A%20%20%20%20return%20_ns%0A%0Aproblem(mo%2C%20ml_exercise_03_description%2C%20ml_exercise_03_starter%2C%20_submission%2C%20ml_exercise_03_submit)</marimo-cell-code>\n        </marimo-island>",
