          "id": "ml-classification-metrics-thresholds-block-3",
          "html": "<marimo-island\n    data-app-id=\"mlphd\"\n    data-cell-id=\"BNjl\"\n    data-reactive=\"true\"\n>\n    <marimo-cell-output>\n    <span></span>\n    </marimo-cell-output>\n    <marimo-cell-code hidden>ml_exercise_04_description%20%3D%20mo.md(%22%22%22%0A%23%23%23%20Exercise%0A%0ADefine%20%60classification_metrics(tp%2C%20fp%2C%20fn)%60%20returning%20a%20dictionary%20with%0A%60precision%60%2C%20%60recall%60%2C%20and%20%60f1%60.%20Return%20%600.0%60%20when%20a%20denominator%20is%20zero.%0A%22%22%22)%0Aml_exercise_04_starter%20%3D%20mo.ui.code_editor(%0A%20%20%20%20value%3D'def%20classification_metrics(tp%2C%20fp%2C%20fn)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20precision%20%3D%20tp%20%2F%20(tp%20%2B%20fp)%20if%20tp%20%2B%20fp%20else%200.0%5Cn%20%20%20%20recall%20%3D%20tp%20%2F%20(tp%20%2B%20fn)%20if%20tp%20%2B%20fn%20else%200.0%5Cn%20%20%20%20f1%20%3D%202%20*%20precision%20*%20recall%20%2F%20(precision%20%2B%20recall)%20if%20precision%20%2B%20recall%20else%200.0%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20%7B%22precision%22%3A%20precision%2C%20%22recall%22%3A%20recall%2C%20%22f1%22%3A%20f1%7D'%2C%0A%20%20%20%20language%3D%22python%22%2C%20label%3D%22Your%20Python%20answer%22%2C%20min_height%3D190%2C%0A)%0Aml_exercise_04_submit%20%3D%20mo.ui.run_button(label%3D%22Submit%20answer%22)</marimo-cell-code>\n</marimo-island>",
